# Product photographs are committed deliberately, unlike everything else
# under storage/app/public.
#
# They are 2.8 MB for the whole catalogue, and keeping them in the repository
# means a clone shows the shop as it is meant to look without running a
# seeder and without reaching two suppliers' websites -- neither of which is
# a thing to depend on during a demo, or offline.
#
# ProductImageSeeder still exists to re-fetch or refresh them.
#
# Anything a member of staff uploads through the admin screens lands here
# too and is NOT wanted in the repository, so this allows the catalogue
# files by name and ignores the rest.

*
!.gitignore
!canroyal-*.png
!solar-*.jpg
!patrol-*.jpg
